# Device testing

- Never reboot the phone (`adb reboot` or anything that power-cycles it); it isn't needed and the phone may not come back on USB.
- To make an install take effect or to reset the app, restart B2G instead: `adb root`, then `adb shell stop b2g && adb shell start b2g`, and wait for the home screen before launching the app.
- After a B2G restart, run `adb forward tcp:6000 localfilesystem:/data/local/firefox-debugger-socket` again before using the Firefox debugger.
